<title>UK: Malaysia's MMC to take stake in UK's N. Petroleum.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's MMC to take stake in UK's N. Petroleum.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil products company Northern Petroleum Plc said on Friday it signed a conditional agreement with Malaysia Mining Corporation Berhad (MMC) for MMC to buy 12 million new ordinary shares in Northern at 35p each.</p>
<p>Northern Petroleum said the new ordinary shares bought by MMC would represent around 46 percent of its enlarged issued share capital. The subscription will total 4.2 million stg.</p>
<p>Northern said it expected the tie-up to open up additional opportunities to acquire quality oil and gas assets.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
